{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42590","headline":"梦仙谣 · 廖融","name":"梦仙谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琪木扶疎系辟邪，麻姑夜宴紫皇家。\n银河旌节摇波影，珠阁笙箫吸月华。\n翠凤引游三岛路，赤龙齐驾五云车。\n星稀犹倚虹桥立，拟就张骞搭汉槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}